  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth-centered dialogue for promoting peace and justice in Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Contribute to peace and stabilisation in Libya by informing policy dialogue on gender justice in Libya. This is supported by one specific objective: strengthen the role of youth and CSOs in shifting attitudes and behaviours towards harmful gender norms in targeted communities.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
